{"material_id": "ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.2023b.q28.material.recovered", "text": "初中生林强的父母望子成龙心切，从小对他寄予厚望，在他们看来，只有严加管教，孩子才能有出息。于是，他们对林强从学习到生活做出了一系列严格的规定。任何情况下都不得有丝毫的通融或改变，也不允许他出现任何细碎的差错，久而久之，林强养成了谨小慎微，凡事都怕出错的行为习惯。他做事总是小心翼翼，反复权衡，慎之又慎，生怕做不好留下遗憾，迟迟下不了决心，哪怕是在课上对老师讲的知识听不懂，需要问老师，他也要权衡再三，林强在学习和生活中无论做什么事情，都是犹豫不决，缺乏随机应变的灵活性。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年下半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "14d3408ed50543ad4baf2045a4dca8eab7fc03a2d9d9043138b5db8f33594361", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2724, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2959, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年下半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 28, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "14d3408ed50543ad4baf2045a4dca8eab7fc03a2d9d9043138b5db8f33594361"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.2023b.q28"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.m5.k02"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.ability.care"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.302.r006", "ntce.outline.302.r030", "ntce.outline.302.r031"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.2023b.q28"], "word_count": 235, "level": "zhongxue", "subject": "jiaoyuzhishi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年下半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年下半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "14d3408ed50543ad4baf2045a4dca8eab7fc03a2d9d9043138b5db8f33594361", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2724, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2959, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年下半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": 